WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:07,540
Is the discussion over?

2
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:08,940
Do you want me to go back for a while?

3
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:10,540
Who are you not allowed to tell Suche?

4
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:11,740
Discuss again

5
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:14,970
Who said just now that he was going to be stuck with water?

6
00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:16,570
Wait until he humbles himself and begs for help

7
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:17,770
That's my assumption

8
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:18,770
Good assumption

9
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:20,770
Next time, don’t discuss it in front of the person involved.

10
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:23,420
Fill the water and leave quickly

11
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:24,620
By the way, a reminder

12
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:25,620
There are wild boar around here

13
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:26,620
Don't drink too much water

14
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:28,020
Turned around and became his meal

15
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:31,400
Why are you here you stupid

16
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:32,400
I follow you

17
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,200
I really want to follow you to find food and drink.

18
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:35,200
I'm afraid I'll starve to death

19
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:36,800
I've finished filling up a round of water.

20
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:38,000
You just found the place

21
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Filling the water back is the stupidest thing to do now

22
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,400
Just fry by the water source until it gets dark.

23
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,000
If I look for him tomorrow, I won’t believe him.

24
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,200
We can get ahead of everything
